# 02_temple_exploration_dark area 46 (3bfa3eff,02_temple_exploration_dark): safe zone u0451 +
# crystal u0452 (inactive) and Medium Ings u0454/u0417. Light the crystal, put the Ings inside the
# zone (InhabitantIdle -> DamageActor, normal then hurtful), walk in and out, shoot through it.
# Run: BUILD=build-port-cov tools/cov/run.sh tools/cov/specs/safezone.py <out> 3bfa3eff,02_temple_exploration_dark --con <this> --fast --frames 2200
