@f700 obj u0454; obj u0451
@f720 send u0451 Increment
@f760 send u0451 Decrement; send u0451 Decrement
@f800 tp 237.9 -194.7 -39.9
@f860 beam power; shoot u0452 20; shoot u0452 3
@f900 shoot u0454 30; shoot u0417 30
@f940 visor dark
@f1000 tp 237.9 -170.0 -38.0; aim 180 -5
@f1060 visor combat; beam dark
@f1070 shoot u0452 30; shoot u0452 charged 30
@f1100 beam annihilator; shoot u0452 30
